{"copyright":{"thirdPartyPermissionsProduced":false,"disclosedToPublic":false,"containsIndication":false,"publisherPermissionOrRightsToDistribute":false,"belongsToUsGov":false,"determinationType":"PUBLIC_USE_PERMITTED","thirdPartyContentCondition":"NOT_SET","belongsToContractor":false,"disclosedInvention":false,"submissionId":20160002631,"containsThirdPartyMaterial":false,"belongsToPublisher":false,"id":"3caaae58088f4770a5db1b86e0eda758","belongsToAuthors":false},"subjectCategories":["Technology Utilization And Surface Transportation"],"exportControl":{"isExportControl":"NO","submissionId":20160002631,"ear":"NO","id":"351f35acf4984949bb1a4ad2dc20d666","itar":"NO"},"distributionDate":"2019-07-11T00:00:00.0000000+00:00","otherReportNumbers":["JSC-CN-35543","Report Number: JSC-CN-35543"],"fundingNumbers":[{"number":"WBS 203950.01.01","submissionId":20160002631,"id":"b7fc352fe44f4608a19082ee96d1c9cc","type":"WBS"}],"title":"Multipurpose Cargo Transfer Bags fro Reducing Exploration Mission Logistics","stiType":"CONFERENCE_PAPER","distribution":"PUBLIC","submittedDate":"2016-03-01T15:57:59.2130000+00:00","authorAffiliations":[{"sequence":0,"submissionId":20160002631,"meta":{"author":{"name":"Baccus, Shelley "},"organization":{"name":"NASA Johnson Space Center","location":"Houston, TX, United States"}},"id":"1fefb355aa994ee39aa1b743c34f9ee0"},{"sequence":1,"submissionId":20160002631,"meta":{"author":{"name":"Broyan, James Lee, Jr."},"organization":{"name":"NASA Johnson Space Center","location":"Houston, TX, United States"}},"id":"d8fb01c5be4c4d0f93342485266064d8"},{"sequence":2,"submissionId":20160002631,"meta":{"author":{"name":"Borrego, Melissa "},"organization":{"name":"Jacobs Technology, Inc.","location":"Houston, TX, United States"}},"id":"bf6e4eca7101404f8b6e56d7343c6385"}],"stiTypeDetails":"Conference Paper","technicalReviewType":"TECHNICAL_REVIEW_TYPE_NONE","modified":"2025-08-31T18:39:21.7150190+00:00","id":20160002631,"legacyMeta":{"__type":"LegacyMetaIndex, StrivesApi.ServiceModel","accessionNumber":""},"created":"2016-03-01T15:57:59.2130000+00:00","center":{"code":"JSC","name":"Johnson Space Center","id":"dd46994b91a94cb2a2722617cbbadc55"},"onlyAbstract":false,"sensitiveInformation":2,"abstract":"The Logistics Reduction (LR) project within the Advanced Exploration Systems (AES) division is tasked with reducing logistical mass and repurposing logistical items. Multipurpose Cargo Transfer Bags (MCTB) have been designed such that they can serve the same purpose as a Cargo Transfer Bag (CTB), the common logistics carrying bag for the International Space Station (ISS). After use as a cargo carrier, a regular CTB becomes trash, whereas the MCTB can be unfolded into a flat panel for reuse. Concepts and potential benefits for various MCTB applications will be discussed including partitions, crew quarters, solar radiation storm shelters, acoustic blankets, and forward osmosis water processing. Acoustic MCTBs are currently in use on ISS to reduce the noise generated by the T2 treadmill, which reaches the hazard limit at high speeds. The development of the AMCTB included identification of keep out zones, acoustic properties, deployment considerations, and structural testing. Features developed for these considerations are applicable to MCTBs for all crew outfitting applications.","isLessonsLearned":false,"disseminated":"DOCUMENT_AND_METADATA","meetings":[{"submissionId":20160002631,"name":"American Inst. of Aeronautics and Astronautics","location":"Reston, VA, United States","id":"f2aa04c1d2df40f08fc7366278eda5e4"},{"country":"United States","submissionId":20160002631,"endDate":"2016-09-16T00:00:00.0000000+00:00","sponsors":[{"meta":{"organization":{"name":"American Inst. of Aeronautics and Astronautics","location":"Reston, VA, United States"}},"meetingId":"f49114f5f29c4e529e487a76d7fcbcf9","id":"9fb02fcfa2384626a98ec5d5621937f1"}],"name":"Space and Astronautics Forum and Exposition","location":"Long Beach, CA","id":"f49114f5f29c4e529e487a76d7fcbcf9","startDate":"2016-09-13T00:00:00.0000000+00:00"}],"publications":[{"submissionId":20160002631,"id":"67179756c2e24be2a85371f3ef7f8344","publicationDate":"2016-09-13T00:00:00.0000000+00:00"}],"status":"CURATED","related":[],"downloads":[{"draft":false,"mimetype":"application/pdf","name":"20160002631.pdf","type":"STI","links":{"original":"/api/citations/20160002631/downloads/20160002631.pdf","pdf":"/api/citations/20160002631/downloads/20160002631.pdf","fulltext":"/api/citations/20160002631/downloads/20160002631.txt"}}],"downloadsAvailable":true,"index":"submissions-2026-11-12-06-24"}